        {"zh": "这恶鬼的肉质稀薄，却富含力量！", "en": "The fiend's flesh is thin, but powerful."},
        {"zh": "栖息于幽暗森林的幽魂！", "en": "Ghost of the dark forest!"},
        {"zh": "寒冰封住了恶鬼的心脏！", "en": "Ice binds the fiend's heart."},
        {"zh": "吸食灵魂，滋养生命！", "en": "Soul sucked, life sustained."},
        {"zh": "恶鬼之魂，永世囚禁！", "en": "Fiend's soul, eternally trapped."},
        {"zh": "正亲的剑，我的剑，永恒！", "en": "Zengqing's blade, my blade, eternal."}
      ]
    },
    "target_acquire": {
